Z||000045||artherd||08-10-2001||04:45 PM||||Hi Eric/Chris (I can't keep track! Met both of you at the West Fest though, your 3.4TDC is just great, I hadden't known you put a turbo on her too, WOW! :)<P>Yes guys, money sucks.  Part of the trouble with a car that has such performance for so little (currently) market-value, is we get the joyriders who abuse their cars, and the cheapasses who do scary things (sone grand am 'upgrades') to their brakes because they 'can't afford' to build a safe car that will not kill them.  Your life, and MY life are dependand on car parts doing their job reliably, so yes they're going to cost money.  I really don't want to hear the whineing anymore.  If you have a safe creative unexpensive SOLUTION however, I'm all ears!!<BR>(but I'm also ordering the ryane 13" brakes, as opposed to holding my breath.)<P><BR>Dual TBs for 2.8s sounds neat, real neat.  I'd love to see it, but then you'd have to kill me :)<P>PS: What, no velocity stack kit?<BR>&lt;ducks and runs&gt;<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
